      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 5 Castle Street,  Donegal Town  F94 N8P2\r\n\r\nExcellent 3 B/r Town House\r\n\r\nCompletely Refurbished in 2015\r\n\r\n\r\nTerrific quiet setting overlooking River Eske yet only 200 metres off The Diamond.\r\nOriginally constructed in 1900, the owners have completely refurbished the property to a very high standard.  Extending to 81.46 sqm. and comprising -\r\n\r\nGround Floor.\tOpen planned Kitchen with Dining & Living Area; Shower Room;\r\n\r\nFirst Floor.\t\t2 No. Bedrooms & Bathroom\r\n\r\nSecond Floor.\t1 No. Bedroom\r\n\r\nPrivate Garden & Storage Shed at rear\t\t\t\t\t       \r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway\t\tTiled floor\r\n\r\nKitchen / Living\t\t5.98 m.  x  3.54 m.\r\n\t\t\t\ttiled floor;  fitted units with built-in oven and hob; overlooking \t\t\t\triver to front and garden at rear;  storage unit under stairs, \t\t\t\tplumbed for washing machine;  Solid fuel stove with back boiler \t\t\t\tfor water and radiators\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\nRear Porch\t\t\tTiled floor;  door to rear\r\n\r\nShower Room\t\tPower shower, toilet and wash basin;  80% tiled\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom No 1\t\t2.98 m.  x  2.57 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tcarpet; overlooking rear garden\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 2\t\t2.86 m.  x  2.52 m.  carpet\r\n\r\n\tP.C.  Dividing wall between Bed 1 & Bed 2 could be removed to create larger room\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.07 m.  x  2.07 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tBath with electric shower overhead, toilet and wash basin; \t\t\t\ttiled around bath and lower walls;  lino flooring\t\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nSecond Floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 3\t\t3.50 m.  x  2.63 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tcarpet;  velox window;  lower wall space in eaves ideal for \t\t\t\tstorage\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nP.V.C.  Double Glazed Windows\t\t\tOil fired central heating\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBoiler House\t\t\t2.83 m.  x  1.60 m.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nStorage Shed\t\t3.79 m.  x  3.08 m.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPrivate south facing garden at rear;    gravelled area to front.\r\n\r\nComprised in part of Folio DL 82138F  County Donegal\r\n\r\nAll external walls dry-lined\r\n  \r\n2014 / 2015 -  All refurbished including dry-lining of external walls, insulation in attic,  new P.V.C.  Double Glazed Windows,  Re-felting of roof,  ground floor raised\r\n\r\nBER - C \t\tBer Number - 105381644"
      },
